OL,3,ATrump rules out joint US-China venture
OL,4,Ato develop AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has ruled out
OL,7,Fany sort of joint venture with China in
OL,8,Fartificial intelligence (AI), arguing
OL,9,Fit would be tantamount to "giving away
OL,10,Fsecrets" to America's main economic
OL,11,Frival.
OL,13,FSpeaking at an event in Washington on
OL,14,FTuesday, Trump again argued against
OL,15,Fputting any restrictions on the
OL,16,Ftechnology that would stifle growth in
OL,17,Fthe future, despite mounting public
OL,18,Fconcern.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
